OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn
OL,6,FWednesday, dry sunny spells and winds
OL,7,Fstrengthening to a fresh breeze. Gusty
OL,8,Fwinds remain on Thursday, and a band
OL,9,Fof rain arrives later. A sunnier, more
OL,10,Fsettled Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
